            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rae"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought that there was to much sugar added in this after I tasted it. So I added an extra tablespoon of vinegar and then decided to let it set and see what happened with it. It was ok but still to sweet. Ended up adding Italian dressing to this. Which made it really good.",
